{"unit_id":"FreePeak__dsh-mux#feature-1","repo":"FreePeak/dsh-mux","commit":"4d717ce014b0248c89fb28cd2e61629a0414ec89","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-mux 的功能「调用 Claude Code」：在 DSH 网页面板、斜杠命令或 mux 工具中提交提示，由本机 Claude Code 处理并返回文本结果。面板和命令使用当前工作目录，agent 工具优先使用会话目录。","source":"generated","evidence":["src/plugin.ts:177-215","src/plugin.ts:217-244"]}
{"unit_id":"FreePeak__dsh-mux#feature-2","repo":"FreePeak/dsh-mux","commit":"4d717ce014b0248c89fb28cd2e61629a0414ec89","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-mux 的功能「续接线程」：再次向已有线程发送提示时，插件将保存的 CLI 会话 ID 传给适配器，并把新一轮问答追加到线程记录，方便延续已有工作。","source":"generated","evidence":["src/plugin.ts:117-164","src/threads.ts:109-127"]}
{"unit_id":"FreePeak__dsh-mux#feature-3","repo":"FreePeak/dsh-mux","commit":"4d717ce014b0248c89fb28cd2e61629a0414ec89","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-mux 的功能「查看 CLI 状态」：打开侧边栏时，面板通过远程服务检查各适配器对应的可执行文件是否在 PATH 中，并显示是否启用，用户可据此选择当前可用的目标。","source":"generated","evidence":["web/entry.tsx:215-240","src/discovery.ts:38-62"]}
{"unit_id":"FreePeak__dsh-mux#feature-4","repo":"FreePeak/dsh-mux","commit":"4d717ce014b0248c89fb28cd2e61629a0414ec89","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-mux 的功能「管理已保存线程」：侧边栏显示线程记录，用户可新建对话或删除选中的记录；删除仅移除本插件保存的记录。","source":"generated","evidence":["web/entry.tsx:281-300","src/remote.ts:88-96","src/threads.ts:144-152"]}
{"unit_id":"FreePeak__dsh-mux#feature-5","repo":"FreePeak/dsh-mux","commit":"4d717ce014b0248c89fb28cd2e61629a0414ec89","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-mux 的功能「从 agent 调用」：DSH 注册的 mux 工具接受目标 CLI、提示文本和可选线程 ID，并返回带运行信息的结果，便于 agent 在更大的任务中委托单轮编码请求。","source":"generated","evidence":["src/plugin.ts:177-215"]}
{"unit_id":"FreePeak__dsh-mux#caveat-1","repo":"FreePeak/dsh-mux","commit":"4d717ce014b0248c89fb28cd2e61629a0414ec89","type":"caveat","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-mux 当前仅启用 Claude Code 发送；其他 CLI 即使出现在状态列表中，也会在调用时返回禁用提示。","source":"generated","evidence":["src/adapters.ts:38-47","src/plugin.ts:99-106"]}
